{"id":"n26007-1-8","stage":2,"title":"줄어들다 · 缩小","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26007-1-8-1","ko":"우리 가게 매출이 요새 많이 줄어들었어요.","zh":"我们店的销售额最近大幅下降了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"가게","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"매출이","meaning":"销售","explanation":"매출：销售；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"매출","audio":"/audio/ecf51b1f43cc5e6be7f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55743","senseId":"1","lemma":"매출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매출이","audio":"/audio/6ef012dbdc337eb5183f.mp3"}},{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"줄어들었어요.","meaning":"缩小，缩少","explanation":"줄어들다：缩小，缩少；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"줄어들다","audio":"/audio/35ba806556c05e8b7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26007","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄어들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄어들었어요","audio":"/audio/e287be32e45feaed4330.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"ecf51b1f43cc5e6b","term":"매출","zh":"销售","audio":"/audio/ecf51b1f43cc5e6be7f9.mp3","entryId":"55743","definition":"出售东西。","pronunciation":["매ː출"]},{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"35ba806556c05e8b","term":"줄어들다","zh":"缩小，缩少","audio":"/audio/35ba806556c05e8b7579.mp3","entryId":"26007","definition":"体积、数量或程度等比原来渐渐变少或变小。","pronunciation":["주러들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a69803572692564fcd4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26007-1-8-2","ko":"그래? 이거 큰일이군.","zh":"是吗？那可真是件大事啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"큰일이군.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.m